#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:35
#: cf571526be6e432cb220b8a2ef50d058
msgid "Generate launch.json Variables"
msgstr "生成 launch.json 变量"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:37
#: 340a23ef1f224b3dab1b46056b178699
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Add ``--vs-launch`` to the configure command after ``--debug`` will auto "
"copy ``.vscode/launch.default.json`` to ``.vscode/launch.json``, if there is"
" no launch.json existing. When you build the target, it will generate the "
"build info to ``.vscode/setting.json``. This will allow you to use them in "
"the launch.json file. Example variables: ``${config:wscript.elf_file_path}``"
" for .elf file path, ``${config:wscript.board}`` for board name, for STM32 "
"target it will also generate a openocd.cfg under the build board folder "
"based on board MCU model. Example command:"
msgstr ""
"在 configure 命令的 ``--debug`` 之后添加 ``--vs-launch``，若不存在 launch.json，将自动复制 "
"``.vscode/launch.default.json`` 至 ``.vscode/launch.json``。构建目标时，将在 "
"``.vscode/setting.json`` 中生成构建信息，可在 launch.json "
"文件中使用这些信息。示例变量：``${config:wscript.elf_file_path}`` 表示 .elf "
"文件路径，``${config:wscript.board}`` 表示板卡名称；对于 STM32 目标，还将根据板卡 MCU 型号在构建板卡目录下生成 "
"openocd.cfg。示例命令："

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:44
#: 115f2d4a0a7d42748303f1a684a139e8
msgid "Setting up VSCode Debugger"
msgstr "配置 VSCode 调试器"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:45
#: d7857996fdd14f5bbd2a8d7f1dee34d6
msgid ""
"With VSCode open to the ArduPilot directory. Open the `Run and Debug` menu "
"(Ctrl+Shift+D). Within the `Run and Debug` menu, select `create a "
"launch.json file`. Then select `Add Configuration`, it should open a "
"launch.json file for setting up debugging configurations.  An example "
"launch.json file can be found below.  Copy-paste the example into the newly "
"created launch.json file in VSCode, overwitting anything that has was pre-"
"defined in the file, and save the file.  This example file is a good place "
"to start but can be modified to your liking.  Should you need to access or "
"edit the file in the future, you can find it in the .vscode directory, or "
"you can simply click on the cog icon in the `Run and Debug` menu."
msgstr ""
"在 VSCode 中打开 ArduPilot 目录。打开「运行和调试」菜单（Ctrl+Shift+D）。在「运行和调试」菜单中，选择「创建 "
"launch.json 文件」，然后选择「添加配置」，将打开用于设置调试配置的 launch.json 文件。下方提供了一个示例 launch.json"
" 文件。将示例内容复制粘贴到 VSCode 中新创建的 launch.json "
"文件中，覆盖文件中预定义的内容，然后保存。此示例文件是很好的起点，可根据需要修改。之后如需访问或编辑该文件，可在 .vscode "
"目录中找到，也可以直接点击「运行和调试」菜单中的齿轮图标。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:51
#: 13d0f14980454d529ace1dd63db522cc
msgid "Example launch.json File"
msgstr "launch.json 示例文件"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:220
#: a5c840d5d6974e8aa67f2d05e2c4e9bf
msgid ""
"Launch SITL with using ``sim_vehicle.py`` : be sure to add ``-D`` to build "
"and launch SITL with debug symbols:"
msgstr "使用 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 启动 SITL：请确保添加 ``-D`` 以构建并以包含调试符号的方式启动 SITL："

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:226
#: 12c9ad26b1e54cdaaec2adcb8b9c30b9
msgid ""
"From the Run and Debug menu select ``(gdb) Attach``, push the green arrow "
"and select the process name for your vehicle's binary (e.g. ``arducopter``)"
msgstr ""
"在「运行和调试」菜单中选择 ``(gdb) Attach``，点击绿色箭头，然后选择飞行器二进制文件的进程名（例如 ``arducopter``）"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:231
#: 6316bf72c770464193a53792e6aca155
msgid ""
"Note that you can switch between the Debug and SITL terminals by clicking in"
" the areas shown in yellow above."
msgstr "注意可以通过点击上方黄色区域在调试终端和 SITL 终端之间切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:233
#: 4f5e4ad56cf040d39b000c7b72fd32f1
msgid ""
"Before or after attaching you may put breakpoints in the code to start "
"debugging."
msgstr "附加之前或之后，可以在代码中设置断点以开始调试。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:239
#: 900a19d7d44b48efa7651142eb812bfe
msgid "Debugging Initialization Tasks and Constructors Using Launch Profiles"
msgstr "使用启动配置文件调试初始化任务和构造函数"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:241
#: da2b516ca921432dbd0c59fe92a82d6e
msgid ""
"The easiest method to debug initialization and constructors is to select the"
" debug points, attach to the executable, and then command \"reboot\" in "
"MAVProxy."
msgstr "调试初始化和构造函数最简便的方法是选择调试断点，附加到可执行文件，然后在 MAVProxy 中执行 「reboot」命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:243
#: e8d075d4d10a4daa8b41eb0bf127bd02
msgid ""
"The ``Launch`` profiles allow debugging of the binaries directly for "
"initialization tasks and constructors, etc. without using MAVProxy. Launch "
"tasks require that the binary to be debugged has already been built. Be sure"
" to run ``./waf copter`` beforehand or the old binary will be debugged "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"``Launch`` 配置文件允许直接对二进制文件进行初始化任务、构造函数等的调试，无需使用 "
"MAVProxy。启动任务要求待调试的二进制文件已提前构建完成。请确保事先运行 ``./waf copter``，否则将调试旧版二进制文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:246
#: aaebf51985de46cb86367e1fccdab63e
msgid "Autotest Debugging Profile"
msgstr "自动化测试调试配置文件"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-using-vscode.rst:247
#: a06a38bc4561430d992782e3813c0183
msgid ""
"This profile does not auto-attach to the correct vehicle binary as the "
"autotest automatically opens & closes new instances of SITL. In order to "
"debug the C++ code at the same time as the Python autotest code create a "
"debug point in the Python code before the relevant C++ will be called. Then "
"attach to the vehicle binary using the \"Attach\" profile. Now that the C++ "
"executable has been attached to GDB you may continue in the Python debugger."
msgstr ""
"由于自动化测试会自动打开和关闭新的 SITL 实例，此配置文件不会自动附加到正确的飞行器二进制文件。若要在调试 Python 自动化测试代码的同时调试 "
"C++ 代码，请在相关 C++ 代码被调用之前在 Python 代码中设置调试断点，然后使用「Attach」配置文件附加到飞行器二进制文件。C++ "
"可执行文件附加到 GDB 后，即可继续在 Python 调试器中进行操作。"
